{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Dify与Coze等低代码/无代码Agent平台\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Dify与Coze等低代码/无代码Agent平台\" dir=\"auto\">Dify与Coze等低代码/无代码Agent平台</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明Dify和Coze这类低代码/无代码Agent平台的核心能力、技术架构，以及它们与代码级框架（如LangChain）的区别和适用场景。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>低代码/无代码Agent平台的定位</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Dify、Coze等平台的定位是<strong>Agent应用开发平台</strong>，将RAG、Workflow、模型管理等功能可视化封装，降低Agent应用开发门槛。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Dify核心能力：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可视化编排</strong></td>\n<td>通过拖拽节点构建复杂工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RAG引擎</strong></td>\n<td>内置文档处理、向量检索、重排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>多模型支持</strong></td>\n<td>支持GPT、Claude、DeepSeek、通义千问等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Agent框架</strong></td>\n<td>支持ReAct、Function Calling等Agent模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>私有化部署</strong></td>\n<td>开源，支持Docker/K8s私有化部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>API发布</strong></td>\n<td>一键发布为REST API或WebApp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Coze核心能力：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Bot开发</strong></td>\n<td>快速创建AI Bot，支持插件和工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Plugin生态</strong></td>\n<td>丰富的预置插件（搜索、绘图、代码等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>多平台分发</strong></td>\n<td>一键发布到Discord、Telegram、微信等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>知识库</strong></td>\n<td>支持文档、表格、图片等多种知识类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>弱私有化</strong></td>\n<td>主要面向云端，私有化能力有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Dify vs Coze对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Dify</th>\n<th>Coze</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>开源</strong></td>\n<td>是（GitHub 30k+ Stars）</td>\n<td>否（字节跳动产品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>私有化</strong></td>\n<td>强支持</td>\n<td>弱支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工作流</strong></td>\n<td>强大（支持条件分支、变量、循环）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>模型灵活性</strong></td>\n<td>强（自托管模型、任意API）</td>\n<td>中等（主要用豆包/第三方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>分发渠道</strong></td>\n<td>API/WebApp</td>\n<td>多平台Bot分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用</strong></td>\n<td>企业内部应用、私有化部署</td>\n<td>快速C端Bot、社交场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>与代码级框架的关系：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">能力层次对比\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│    Dify / Coze (应用层平台)           │\n│    可视化编排 + 预置组件 + 一键部署     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│    LangChain / LangGraph (编排框架)    │\n│    灵活编排 + 深度定制 + 代码控制       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│    LLM API (模型能力层)                │\n│    GPT-4 / Claude / DeepSeek         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：Dify Workflow的核心概念（伪代码表示）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Dify Workflow的可视化节点对应代码逻辑</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">workflow_start</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. LLM节点 - 理解意图</span>\n    intent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"分析用户意图\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 条件分支节点</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> intent <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询知识库\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 知识检索节点</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> knowledge_retrieval_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. LLM节点 - 生成回答</span>\n        answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> intent <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"执行操作\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 工具调用节点</span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> params<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>input_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 结束节点</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> answer\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：什么场景应该选择Dify/Coze，什么场景应该选择LangChain？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：快速原型验证、非技术团队、标准化场景用低代码平台；复杂业务逻辑、深度定制、性能敏感场景用代码级框架。实际上常采用混合模式——原型用低代码验证，核心链路用代码自研。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：Dify的RAG引擎相比自研RAG有什么优劣？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：优势是开箱即用、内置优化（分块策略、重排序、引用溯源）；劣势是灵活性受限、深度调优空间有限。适合RAG需求标准化、快速上线的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：低代码平台可以完全替代代码开发。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：低代码平台适合标准化场景和快速验证，但复杂业务逻辑、深度性能优化、特殊安全需求等场景仍需要代码级开发。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}